# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Fatigue / rainflow counting  — the heart of this subsystem
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Two independent ASTM E1049-85 implementations, deliberately. They differ in
# how they close out the residual half-cycles at the end of a series, which
# shifts damage by a small but non-zero amount. Run the parameter recovery
# against BOTH and keep whichever produces the tighter residual collapse.
rainflow==3.2.0              # iamlikeme/rainflow — simple, returns (rng, mean, count)
fatpack==0.7.5               # gunnstein/fatpack — adds S-N curve + Palmgren-Miner
                             #   objects, endurance/knee handling, Goodman correction
 
 
